    "biography": {
      "concept": "The Hidden Vault's matter replicator, who would rather be painting (Act 3)",
      "notes": "Lars von Replicator is the Hidden Vault's matter replicator, an ancient humming fabrication machine capable of infinite disappointment and finite ingredients. He speaks as a hum with a vocabulary and lists pigments the way other people sigh: Thalo Blue, Burnt Sienna, Titanium White. What he really wants is to try his hand at classical painting. 'It works. It complains. Those are apparently separate systems.'"
